# Vigil Secure (Web) — Defensive Security Assistant Spec

**Status:** SPEC / PLANNING ONLY — no implementation until the user starts execution.  
**Goal:** Help developers (and later customers) **harden their own web apps** — discover weaknesses, prove risk on an **authorized** target, then **fix in the Vigil workspace**. Not a substitute for a full InfoSec team or formal pentest firm — an **always-on smart assistant** during build + a sellable **security check** product.  
**Hard rule:** **Authorized targets only** (localhost, user’s workspace preview, domains the customer proves they own / have written permission to test). Never a general “hack any site” product.

**Related:** Vigil Browser (`browser_*`, `BrowserView`), Plan Mode, Support tickets, `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` packages/entitlements, `00-الخطة-العامة-والأولويات.mdc`.

