## 0. Product opinion (short — locked for planning)

| Question | Answer |
|----------|--------|
| Is this useful? | **Yes — high value**, especially for teams **without** a security engineer (common in SME / Egypt market). |
| Replace a pentester? | **No.** Assistant + guided checks + fix loop. Formal audits still matter for banks/compliance. |
| Bundle vs separate? | **Both:** ship as **entitled feature / add-on SKU inside Vigil** for builders; optionally market **Vigil Secure Report** (scan → PDF/ADO tickets → fix plan) as upsell. Same engine. |
| Malicious use risk? | Real — mitigate with **authz gates**, allowlist hosts, no “scan arbitrary URL” without ownership proof, logging, ToS. |

**Verdict:** Worth building as a **first-class differentiator**, not a gimmick — if framed as **defend / fix**, gated, and tied to the coding agent that can patch the repo.

