## 4. North-star loop (defend, don’t “just hack”)

```text
1. Open target in Vigil Browser (project preview / allowlisted URL)
2. User: "اختبر أمان الصفحة دي" / Start Secure scan
3. Vigil runs pack (passive → active with confirm)
4. Findings list: severity, OWASP category, evidence (screenshot/response snippet), affected route
5. User: "صلّح" → Plan or direct agent patches workspace
6. Retest same checks → green / residual risk
7. Optional: export report PDF / publish ADO Bugs
```

