## 7. Agent tools (conceptual)

| Tool | Role |
|------|------|
| `secure_allowlist_*` | Manage authorized hosts |
| `secure_scan_passive` | Headers, cookies, deps, secrets heuristics |
| `secure_scan_active` | Gated active pack on allowlisted URL |
| `secure_finding_fix` | Patch suggestion + apply via normal write tools |
| `secure_retest` | Re-run checks for finding ids |
| `secure_report_export` | Markdown/PDF metadata |

Browser tools remain `browser_*`; Secure orchestrates them + scanners.

**Policy:** Active scan tools require allowlist + explicit user confirmation; blocked in nested workers unless opted in.

