## 8. Data model (Firestore — account)

| Collection | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| `secureAllowlists` | Verified hosts per user/org |
| `secureScans` | Scan runs, pack, target, status |
| `secureFindings` | Severity, category, evidence refs, status open/fixed |
| `secureReports` | Customer-facing report snapshots |

Never store third-party attack tooling configs that enable unauthenticated mass scanning as a public API without authz.

