## 11. Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Developer can run Secure Quick on project preview without knowing OWASP names  
- [ ] Active scan **refuses** random public URLs without allowlist/ownership  
- [ ] At least one finding can be fixed in-repo and retested to clear  
- [ ] Arabic simple explanation available per finding category  
- [ ] Report export for entitled accounts  
- [ ] Product copy never markets “hack any website”  

