## 14. Non-goals

- Offensive hacking of unauthorized third-party sites  
- Replacing ISO/PCI formal audits in v1  
- DDoS / stress-as-a-service  
- Teaching weaponized exploit chains as a feature  
- Shipping unrestricted public scan API  

